#: includes/admin/views/settings-connections.php:48
msgid "Additional connections can be used by Smart Routing to send specific emails through a different SMTP account."
msgstr "Zusätzliche Verbindungen kann Smart Routing nutzen, um bestimmte E-Mails über ein anderes SMTP-Konto zu senden."

#: includes/admin/views/settings-connections.php:54
